a. Inward business
i. Broker to have adequate specific knowledge of the country whose business is being offered like: political stability,
economic position, local regulations, tax laws, etc.
ii. Introduce new business/ products depending on the reinsurers business plan and risk appetite
b. Outward business
i. Rating and market credibility of the reinsurer
